{"articleNo":"155297","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=155297&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"갑의 횡포를 신고해주세요!","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.08.08","hit":"3456","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">1. 최근 일부 공직자의 '갑질'과 관련하여 사회문제가&nbsp;발생하고 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 우리 대학교 교직원이&nbsp;우월한 지위와 권한을 이용하여 직무관련자에게 부당한 압력을 행사하거나 무리한 요구를 하는 경우 아래 사항을 참고하여&nbsp;신고바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">가. 특별 신고</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 2016.8.8. ~ 11.15.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">나.&nbsp;신고방법 : 청렴신문고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"> (<a href=\"http://1398.acrc.go.kr/\">http://1398.acrc.go.kr</a>)</span></p><a href=\"http://1398.acrc.go.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/48819519-983d-4b1a-9fef-abff7d3596f9.jpg\"></a> \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
